{"nodes": [{"id": "_claude_aidlc_common_stages_construction_build_and_test_build_and_test", "label": "Build and Test stage", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/stages/construction/build-and-test.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs once after all per-unit stages finish, consuming code-generation outputs across every unit, so build and test instructions are authored against the assembled system rather than per unit in isolation."}, {"id": "_claude_aidlc_common_stages_construction_build_and_test_strategy_aware_test_generation", "label": "Strategy-aware test instruction generation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/stages/construction/build-and-test.md", "source_location": "### Step 4-8: Generate Test Instructions (Strategy-Aware)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Which test-instruction files exist is driven by the active Test Strategy level, and the levels are explicitly soft guidelines so additional test types may be generated when context demands (a Minimal security-patch may still warrant security tests). Performance and security instructions are conditional on matching NFR requirements existing."}, {"id": "_claude_aidlc_common_stages_construction_build_and_test_execute_and_self_fix", "label": "Execute build and tests with bounded self-fix", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/aidlc-common/stages/construction/build-and-test.md", "source_location": "### Step 10: Execute Build and Tests", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The stage actually runs the commands it documented and updates the summary with real results rather than instructions alone; on failure it diagnoses and fixes, but the retry budget is capped at two attempts before the failure is logged and escalated to the human at the gate, 